# [MOPS](../wg/mops.html)

## Summary

The Media Operational Concepts and Considerations (MOPS) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session included an update on the active working group document `draft-ietf-mops-network-overlay-impacts`, an update on activities at the Streaming Video Technology Alliance (SVTA), two operational presentations on streaming high-profile live sports events in Mexico and Brazil, and an industry panel discussion on real-world video delivery challenges in the Americas.

Key themes of the meeting included managing massive traffic bursts during live sports, the operational impacts of encrypted transport protocols on network visibility and telemetry, strategies for scaling edge caching, and handling legacy client hardware constraints.

